1
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,400
邓菲女议员 请问你如何回应
Councilwoman Dunphy, how do you respond

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,560
外界认为你穿着新套装性感非凡的观点
to allegations that you look super sexy in your new suit?

3
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,640
我还没当选呢
Uh, I haven't been elected yet.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,300
快点 孩子们 我们得去投票了
Come on, kids! We gotta vote!

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,020
-亲爱的 拜托你别拍了 -人家太兴奋了嘛
- Honey, come on. Please stop filming. - I'm just excited!

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:17,200
从今以后 你就要当上女议员了
After today, you are going to be a councilwoman,

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,580
而我则会成为第一丈夫
and I am going to be a first husband.

8
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:21,060
你要是再不停拍
And if you don't stop filming,

9
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,740
你就将成为我的前一任丈夫了
you're going to be my first husband.

10
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,460
好了 大伙儿都赶紧的
All right, everybody, come on!

11
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,800
你们记住自己的职责了吗 孩子们
Do you know what you're doing, kids?

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,880
你们几个负责电话银行[电话联络选民拉票]
You guys are manning the phone banks.

13
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,160
艾丽克斯 你是他们的头儿
Alex, you're in charge of that.

14
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,980
凭什么该她当头儿啊 什么是电话银行啊
Wh-why is she in charge? And what's--what's a phone bank?

15
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,700
这就是原因
That's why.

16
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:33,860
-菲尔 -我知道
- Phil. - I got it.

17
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:37,260
我负责接送50名十佳老人去投票站
I will be driving 50 of our finest senior citizens to the polls,

18
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,360
当然 前提是 他们还能记得这件事
assuming, of course, that they remember that I'm coming for them.

19
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,220
-"你这是在哪儿呀" -说得好
- Where you at? - High-five.

20
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,100
老年人就爱忘事
Old people occasionally forget things.

21
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,660
好了 各位 我们出发吧 出发吧
Okay. All right, everybody, let's go. Let's go.

22
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,780
等等等等等等 马上就好
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait! Real quick!

23
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,940
抱歉 大家都围过来 快点
Sorry. Everybody get in there. Jump in there.

24
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,560
我要说的是 我们为你倍感骄傲
I just want to say how proud of you we all are.

25
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:52,520
你就是鼓舞人心的榜样
You're an inspiration.

26
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,900
谁能想到20年前
Who would have thought that 20 years ago

27
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,500
当你正值青春大好年华时
when you were still in the bloom of your youth--

28
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,386
够了 我要去开车了
Okay, I'm gonna go start the car.

29
00:00:59,160 --> 00:00:59,860
克莱尔喜欢争强好胜
Claire likes to win.

30
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,420
她8岁时 一个参加女童子军的朋友
When she was 8, a little girl scout friend of hers

31
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:03,940
吹嘘自己能卖出最多的饼干
bragged she could sell the most cookies.

32
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:06,300
结果克莱尔挨家挨户推销
Damn if Claire didn't walk the neighborhood

33
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:09,380
走到脚板起泡 比她多卖了10盒饼干
till she got blisters on her feet and won by ten boxes.

34
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,860
最精彩之处是
Best part is

35
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,840
克莱尔甚至都不是女童子军
Claire wasn't even a girl scout.

36
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,600
克莱尔 您的用心之选
The choice is Claire!

37
00:01:16,791 --> 00:01:19,874
镇议员选举 请投克莱尔·邓菲一票
Vote Claire Dunphy for town council.

38
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,009
爱死这个了
Aw, I love it!

39
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:25,420
-怎么样 -我太喜欢了
- What do you think, huh? - I love it.

40
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,080
我们从克莱格分类广告网站上买的
We got it on Craigslist.

41
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,660
原本是小贩吆喝玉米饼的
Came off a taco truck.

42
00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:33,511
-真的 -我很感激你们为我做的一切
- It did. - I love that you're doing this for me.

43
00:01:33,511 --> 00:01:35,190
-多谢了 -没事
- Thank you! - You're welcome.

44
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,400
我知道克莱尔把输赢看得有多重要
I know how important winning is to Claire.

45
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:39,280
而我又喜欢装饰打扮
And I love to festoon things.

46
00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:40,340
我们就是她的梦之队
We're her dream team.

47
00:01:40,580 --> 00:01:42,380
所以我们专门腾出今天 送莉莉去学校后
So we cleared the whole day, dropped Lily off at school,

48
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,300
马上就去投票了
and voted first thing.

49
00:01:43,421 --> 00:01:47,753
尽管某人"基"情爆发 难以自控
Although, uh, one of us had a bit of a dimpled chad situation.

50
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:50,220
能请你再演示一次如何使用这机器吗 基德
Can you tell me how this machine works again, Chad?

51
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:52,720
当然 没问题
Oh, sure. No problem.

52
00:01:53,992 --> 00:01:55,522
我就看一眼 就看一眼
Just wanna look in here. Just--

53
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:09,340
谢了 谢了
Thank you. Thank you.

54
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:10,772
-再见 再见 -有劳了各位
- Bye! Bye!- Thank you, guys!

55
00:02:10,772 --> 00:02:15,927
我"克"以肯定杜恩输定了
I can see Clairely now that Duane is gone.

56
00:02:16,420 --> 00:02:18,480
再见 谢了 我的妈呀
Bye! Thank you! Oh, my gosh.

57
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,160
行了 大伙儿快上车 出发 出发
Okay, everybody, get in the car. Let's go. Let's go.

58
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,320
祝你好运 克莱尔
Good luck today, Claire.

59
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,980
劳莉 谢谢你
Oh, Laurie, thank you.

60
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:25,760
随带一提 我们家有天大的好消息
Hey, by the way, we have some really good news.

61
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,900
-怎么了 -贝琦被俄勒冈州大学录取了
- What's that? - Becky got into the University of Oregon.

62
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:29,460
恭喜了
Oh, congratulations!

63
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:30,660
你有什么消息吗 海莉
Any news, Haley?

64
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:32,660
暂 暂时还 还没有
Uh, uh, no, not-- not yet,

65
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:34,060
不过 真为你感到开心呢
but, you know, super psyched!

66
00:02:34,538 --> 00:02:37,100
等待录取的过程就如同一场噩梦
This whole waiting-to-hear thing has been a nightmare

67
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,340
从收到第一封回信开始就缠绕着我
since the very first letter.

68
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,660
我太紧张了 我不敢看
I'm too nervous. I can't do it.

69
00:02:43,723 --> 00:02:44,887
亲爱的邓菲小姐
"Dear miss Dunphy,

70
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,920
我们抱歉地通知你
we regret to inform you..."

71
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,780
然后呢 别吊我胃口啊
What?! Don't leave me hanging!

72
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,840
从那以后 我决定只把好消息带回家
After that, I decided to only tell my parents good news.

73
00:02:56,940 --> 00:02:58,120
就只剩一所学校没回信了
I have one school left,

74
00:02:58,303 --> 00:02:59,820
而我唯一收到的好消息
and the only good news I've gotten

75
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:01,220
就是我那烦死人的邻居贝琦
is that my annoying neighbor Becky

76
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:02,580
要搬去俄勒冈了
is moving back east to Oregon.

77
00:03:03,940 --> 00:03:05,880
-曼尼 拿笔记下来 -我身上没带笔
- Manny, write this down. - I didn't bring a pen.

78
00:03:06,220 --> 00:03:08,700
选举日就是美国最辉煌的时刻
Election day is America at its finest.

79
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:11,460
人民当家做主 政府俯首听命
The people speak, and the government listens.

80
00:03:11,460 --> 00:03:12,760
我不知道你们哥伦比亚是怎么运作的
I don't know what they do in Colombia.

81
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,140
鬼才晓得 别问了
No one does, and don't ask.

82
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,680
虽说投票本身就是一项特权
I mean, we know that voting's a privilege,

83
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,560
可当选票上出现我女儿的名字时
but for my daughter to have her name on that ballot,

84
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:19,620
意义就特别重大了
it just means so much more--

85
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,780
算了 我还是晚点再投票吧
You know what? I think I'm gonna vote later.

86
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,220
为什么 你要去哪里啊
What? Where are you going?

87
00:03:24,220 --> 00:03:25,763
队伍排太长了
Ah, the line is too long.

88
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:28,980
就3个人而已 而且又没人带枪
It's only three people! And nobody has a gun!

89
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,440
我们在这里 我叫克莱尔
We're here, we're Claire,

90
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:34,900
接受这个事实吧
get used to it!

91
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,020
我不确定那口号能让人记得住
You know, I'm not sure if that's tracking.

92
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:38,800
来 让我试一试
Here, let me try one.

93
00:03:39,820 --> 00:03:43,920
无需千里眼 也"克"看出"莱"该选谁
You don't have to be Clairevoyant to know who to vote for.

94
00:03:44,294 --> 00:03:46,378
镇议员选举 请投邓菲一票
Vote Dunphy for town council.

95
00:03:46,378 --> 00:03:48,307
是克莱尔·邓菲
Uh, uh, uh, Claire Dunphy.

96
00:03:48,624 --> 00:03:50,400
她名叫克莱尔
Uh, C-Caire's her first name.

97
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,380
抱歉我说得不太清"克"[楚]
I'm sorry if that wasn't Claire.

98
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:55,820
我的天 你看 明明眼前就是垃圾桶
Oh, my God. Look at that. There's a trash can right there,

99
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:58,360
那男的还随手乱丢废纸
and that guy just threw his paper on the sidewalk.

100
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:00,820
喂 穿黄夹克的那个
Hey! You in the yellow jacket.

101
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:03,220
捡起来 丢进垃圾桶里
Pick it up and put it in the trash.

102
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:09,760
-我的妈呀 他还真照做了 -是的
- Oh, my God. He did it. - Yes, he did.

103
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,939
来 让我试一下
Ooh, here. Let me try one.I'll try...

104
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:14,620
喂 龙纹身的女孩 不要随意乱穿马路
Hey, dragon tattoo, no jaywalking!

105
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,180
亲娘啊
oh, my gosh.

106
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:18,900
小喇叭真有威力
This is an instrument of power.

107
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,760
用来卖玉米饼怎么就不畅销呢
How could they not sell tacos?

108
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,620
你知道我们可以怎样利用这玩意吗
You know what we could do with this thing?

109
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,060
小卡 我们绝对可以造福社会啊
Cam, we could really make a difference.

110
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,760
我们可以化身为"改变之声"
We could be the voice of change.

111
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,100
我懂了
Ooh, I got it!

112
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,220
立刻去那家弄丢我衬衫的干洗店吼吼看
Let's go yell at the dry cleaner that lost my shirt.

113
00:04:31,380 --> 00:04:32,460
快过来 伙伴
Come on, gang.

114
00:04:33,187 --> 00:04:37,180
今天邓菲一家要全力出击
Today is the Dunphys at their best.

115
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,920
我是《每周救星》报的记者 介意我
I'm from the "Weekly Saver." Mind if I ask you

116
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:44,160
-问几个有关选举的问题吗 -随便问
- a couple questions about the big election? - Not at all.

117
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:45,080
向我开炮吧
Fire away.

118
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,640
你今天会投谁一票呢
Who are you voting for today?

119
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,620
克莱尔·邓菲
Claire Dunphy.

120
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,960
总算听到有人提这名字了
Finally. I've been waiting for someone to say that name.

121
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:51,480
为什么
Why?

122
00:04:51,816 --> 00:04:54,620
因为在下就是克莱尔·邓菲
Uh... Because I am Claire Dunphy.

123
00:04:54,620 --> 00:04:57,280
抱歉 我是从广告营销部调过来的
Oh, sorry. They moved me over from ad sales.

124
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:58,340
我们轮流报道新闻
We take turns reporting.

125
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,940
你对于今天的胜算有多大把握
How do you feel about your chances today?

126
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:02,380
比我几分钟之前预想的要差了很多
Not as good as I did a few minutes ago.

127
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:03,400
不 她信心满满
No, she feels great.

128
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:06,249
志在必得 全家人都志在必得
Um, her spirits are high. The whole family's high.

129
00:05:06,557 --> 00:05:08,110
-拿去编头条新闻吧 -菲尔 别
- There's your headline. - Phil, no.

130
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:09,385
来张全家福怎么样
Uh, how about a photo of all of you?

131
00:05:09,385 --> 00:05:11,473
-当然没问题 -妈妈 标签
- Yeah. Sure. Yes. - Mom, mom, mom. Tag.

132
00:05:11,473 --> 00:05:12,450
-衣服标签还在呢 -我的天
- Tag's still on. - Oh, my Goodness.

133
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:12,860
谢了
Thank you.

134
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:15,320
不然拍照可就尴尬了 好
That would have been a really awkward picture. Okay.

135
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:19,400
天啊
No!

136
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,400
那是什么啊
What is that?

137
00:05:20,420 --> 00:05:21,200
是牙齿吗
Is that a tooth?

138
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,646
-好恶 -太强悍了
- Ew! - Awesome!

139
00:05:22,646 --> 00:05:23,966
你都多大了
How old are you? No!

140
00:05:23,966 --> 00:05:25,737
-再来一次 -怎么会这样啊
- Do it again! - How does that even happen?

141
00:05:25,737 --> 00:05:28,660
以前溜冰时摔的 就装了颗假牙
It's a-a fake tooth from an old ice-skating injury.

142
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:30,340
-现在松脱了 -天呐 干嘛非得是今天啊
- It just fell out. - Oh, my gosh. Why today?!

143
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:31,577
-怎么办啊 -别大惊小怪
- What about the... - Let's not overreact.

144
00:05:31,577 --> 00:05:34,606
-让我看看 -好吧 好
- Let's--let me see it. - Okay. All right.

145
00:05:37,180 --> 00:05:38,360
拍好了 谢谢
Got it. Thanks.

146
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,440
你刚刚怎么了
What happened back there?

147
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,140
太多人排队 我懒得等
Line was too long. I couldn't wait.

148
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:51,060
你买冰沙还等过45分钟呢
I've seen you wait 45 minutes in line for sherbet!

149
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:53,186
那是因为我喜欢吃冰沙 行吗
Well, I happen to like sherbet, okay?

150
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,640
我带你去的那地方
That place I take you

151
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:56,260
有全西海岸最好吃的冰沙
has the greatest sherbet on the west coast.

152
00:05:56,380 --> 00:05:59,060
他们有柠檬冰沙 椰子冰沙
They got lime sherbet, they got coconut sherbet.

153
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,100
怎么聊到冰沙去了
Why are we talking about sherbet?

154
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,560
他明显是在转移话题
He's clearly changing the subject.

155
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,320
你怎么没上学啊
Why aren't you in school?

156
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:03,740
他又转移话题了
He's doing it again.

157
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,400
曼尼说得对 你就像只"阿迪亚"
Manny's right. You're being very ardilla.

158
00:06:06,740 --> 00:06:08,820
-"阿迪亚" -没错 就是那种
- "Ardilla"? - Yeah, you know, the--

159
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:10,434
就是那什么
The one that--that--

160
00:06:10,444 --> 00:06:11,720
-兔子吗 我像兔子吗 -不 不是
- Rabbit? I was being rabbit-y? - No, another one

161
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,460
-是大脸蛋 大尾巴的 -花栗鼠吗
- With the cheeks and the tail and... - Chipmunk?

162
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:15,559
-负鼠吗 -她说的明显是松鼠
- Possum? -Okay, obviously she means squirrel.

163
00:06:15,559 --> 00:06:16,680
你之前"古怪如松鼠"
You were being squirrely then,

164
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,700
-现在也是"古怪如松鼠" -总比像老鼠好
- You're being squirrely now. - Better than being a rat.

165
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:20,600
曼尼 让我和他谈谈
Manny, give us a minute.

166
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:23,060
当然好 我毫不费力就戳穿了他
Oh, sure. I served him up on a silver platter.

167
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:27,920
怎么了
What?

168
00:06:30,238 --> 00:06:31,683
好吧 没什么大不了的
All right, it's no big deal.

169
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,040
有个女人在那儿工作
There was a woman working there.

170
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,220
我不想让她见到我
I didn't want her to see me.

171
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:37,300
-她是谁 -她叫多蒂
- Who is she? - Her name is Dottie.

172
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:39,200
她是我离婚后的第一任女友
She's the first woman I dated after my divorce.

173
00:06:39,610 --> 00:06:41,528
你跟迪迪离婚后勾搭上了多蒂
You dated a Dottie after Dede?

174
00:06:41,528 --> 00:06:43,086
你搞错重点了
Y-you're focusing on the wrong thing here.

175
00:06:43,086 --> 00:06:45,198
重点是 我和她不是好聚好散的
The--the point is it ended badly.

176
00:06:45,444 --> 00:06:47,690
我试图和平分手 可是
I tried to let her down easy, but, uh,

177
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:49,440
她没能坦然接受
she didn't take it too well.

178
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:51,400
其实 我也不知道她是怎么接受的
Actually, I don't know how she took it,

179
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:52,623
因为我没看见
'cause I wasn't there.

180
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,480
我们谈了几周恋爱 然后就 你懂的
We dated a few weeks, then after we... You know,

181
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:58,440
我趁她没醒 从她家偷偷溜了
I slipped out of her house before she woke up

182
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,500
再也没联系过她
and never called her again.

183
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:02,180
我把裤子扔在她家院子 把汽车挂的空挡
Put my pants on in her yard, put the car in neutral,

184
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:04,100
使之缓缓驶出车道 车灯都没敢打开
let it roll down the driveway, lights off.

185
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,680
哎呀 可耻历史我说不下去了
Hey, I can't talk about this anymore.

186
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:08,060
所以就因为那个女人
So because of this woman,

187
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,960
你没给你女儿投票
you didn't vote for your daughter?

188
00:07:10,077 --> 00:07:12,519
那是克莱尔啊 我们要让她赢
It's Claire! We need her to win!

189
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:15,200
我可不希望她肺都气炸掉 把怒火都撒在我们头上
I don't want to be around when something that tight comes unraveled.

190
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,680
我会想办法的
I'll figure out something.

191
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,460
也许工作人员是轮班的
Maybe those poll workers take shifts.

192
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:21,780
别胆小地躲在自己的窝里
Stop hiding in your little cave like a--

193
00:07:22,085 --> 00:07:25,056
像那啥一样 那什么...
Like, you know. Like the-- the--the--

194
00:07:25,135 --> 00:07:26,325
-别再让我猜了 -不是
- I really don't wanna do this again. - No, the--

195
00:07:26,325 --> 00:07:29,562
不不不 那种大家伙 浑身长毛的
No. No. The big one, like, uh, the monster furry one.

196
00:07:29,798 --> 00:07:32,503
唉 我怎么老是记不住动物名字
Ay, why can't I remember any animal names?

197
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,760
欢迎乘坐邓菲快车
Climb aboard the Dunphy Express.

198
00:07:36,401 --> 00:07:38,490
下一站——民主
Next stop--democracy.

199
00:07:38,689 --> 00:07:39,860
-别 别 -请留步
- Well--no, no... - Please don't go.

200
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,140
我保证 不再开玩笑了
I won't do that anymore. I promise.

201
00:07:41,591 --> 00:07:44,264
对了 我们半路停一下
Oh. Uh, we need to make a quick stop.

202
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,500
我要取我的新眼镜
I gotta pick up my new glasses.

203
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:47,989
不行啊 我...
No can do. I, uh...

204
00:07:48,134 --> 00:07:49,739
还有很多人等着我呢
I got a lot of people waitin', so...

205
00:07:49,739 --> 00:07:51,440
就两分钟而已
It'll just take two minutes.

206
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,920
没有眼镜 我连选票都看不清
I can't even see the ballot without my glasses.

207
00:07:54,862 --> 00:07:56,900
我要是投错了票
I mark the wrong box,

208
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:58,640
新一届议会就会叫我和男人结婚了
next thing you know I'll be married to a guy.

209
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:01,295
允许同性婚姻 不代表强制同性结婚 沃特
Yeah, I-- I don't think it's mandatory, Walt.

210
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:04,140
我跳舞风度翩翩 基佬们不会放过我的
I'm a good dancer. They'll come for me.

211
00:08:04,955 --> 00:08:05,824
必须的
Oh, yeah.

212
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,100
他们会把你的衣服扣子弄坏
They will break all your buttons...

213
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:09,980
然后说你们送来时就是这样
and say you brought it in that way.

214
00:08:09,980 --> 00:08:11,214
好 快跑 快跑
Okay, go, go, go!

215
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:14,280
世间不平事太多 正好趁机泄私愤
Turns out we had a lot of axes to grind.

216
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:17,680
而且装备齐全 所以我俩就玩个不停了
And a hybrid, so there was virtually no stopping us.

217
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:19,460
别看那电影
Do not see that movie!

218
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,500
那电影会让你哭笑不得
You will neither laugh nor cry!

219
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,240
"全市最棒披萨"
"Best pizza in the city"?

220
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:25,440
其实连"全街最棒"都算不上
Not even the best pizza on this street.

221
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:28,180
宣传照上的发型根本不是在这家店做的
They do not do the hair of the people on those pictures!

222
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,100
"完全免费检查"
"Totally free checking"?

223
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,500
别做梦了
Don't bank on it!

224
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,260
好了 刚刚很好玩
Okay, that was really fun,

225
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,300
但我们得回去帮克莱尔拉票了
But now we gotta go back to campaigning for Claire.

226
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,720
这话我们说了两小时了
We've been saying that for two hours.

227
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,608
没错 但现在我是说真的
Yes, but now I-I really mean it.

228
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,740
-天呐 那是桑迪 -桑德拉·布洛克吗[名演员]
- Oh, my god, there's Sandy! - Sandra Bullock?

229
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:43,040
是啊 桑德拉·布洛克
Yeah, Sandra Bullock.

230
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:45,058
我和她是好朋友 所以我叫她桑迪
We're such good friends, I call her "Sandy," So...

231
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:47,100
逗你的 是莉莉幼儿园的桑迪啦
No, Sandy who works at Lily's preschool.

232
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:48,160
-她在那儿 -哦 对
- Right there. - Oh, yeah.

233
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:50,140
-你知道吗 她订婚了 -不是吧
- You know, she got engaged. - No!

234
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:52,308
-跟她那基佬男友吗 -是啊
- To the gay boyfriend? - Totally.

235
00:08:52,308 --> 00:08:54,260
不是吧 她怎么没看出来啊
Oh, how does she not see it?

236
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,420
要是我男朋友也那么帅
If I was with somebody that gorgeous,

237
00:08:55,460 --> 00:08:56,740
我也不会在乎他的"口味"了
I'd overlook a few quirks, too.

238
00:08:56,980 --> 00:08:58,340
首先 谢谢夸奖
First of all, thank you.

239
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,440
其次
Second of all...

240
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,240
说得太有道理了
point well taken.

241
00:09:00,695 --> 00:09:03,458
唉 可怜的桑迪啊 真替她伤心
I don't know. Poor Sandy. I feel so bad for her.

242
00:09:03,458 --> 00:09:05,560
-还不如单身一人呢 -是吗
- Well, it's better than being alone. - Is it?

243
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,180
她看过来了
She's looking over here.

244
00:09:07,334 --> 00:09:08,977
-我的天呐 -米奇尔 你坐到按钮了
- Oh, my god. - Mitchell, you're sitting on the button.

245
00:09:08,977 --> 00:09:10,512
什么 我没有 没坐到
What? No--no, I'm not. No, I'm not!

246
00:09:10,512 --> 00:09:11,740
它卡住了
The--it's stuck!

247
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:12,860
最后一次是你用的
And you're the one that had it last

248
00:09:12,871 --> 00:09:14,840
-你用它向奶酪店喊话 -因为啊
- when you were talking to the cheese shop! - Because you know what?

249
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,040
如果你要推销松露奶酪
If you advertise truffle cheese,

250
00:09:16,260 --> 00:09:18,260
-就要抓住顾客的期望 -你好啊 桑迪
- there are certain expectations... - Hi, Sandy.

251
00:09:20,730 --> 00:09:23,440
我代表克莱尔·邓菲致电给您
Yeah, I'm calling on behalf of Claire Dunphy.

252
00:09:23,825 --> 00:09:25,420
-多美的名字啊 -她曾是普通百姓
- What a beautiful name. - She used to be a citizen.

253
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:27,660
我代表镇议会候选人克莱尔·邓菲致电给您
I'm calling on behalf of Claire Dunphy for town council.

254
00:09:27,660 --> 00:09:28,826
好 要不这样吧
All right. How about this?

255
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,480
如果你投票给克莱尔·邓菲
if you vote for Claire Dunphy...

256
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:34,260
你这辈子都不用交税了
You won't have to pay taxes for the rest of your life.

257
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:35,220
投克莱尔一票
Vote for Claire!

258
00:09:36,489 --> 00:09:38,600
卢克 你这是干嘛
Luke! What are you doing?

259
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,480
你不能这么说
You can't say that!

260
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,460
政客都是这样的
Oh, like she'd be the first politician

261
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:43,080
竞选承诺向来不用兑现
to make a promise she can't keep.

262
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:45,520
是吗 也许我也不想跟你说话
Well, maybe I don't want to talk to you, either.

263
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:47,800
也许是你在烦我
Maybe you are the one that is bothering me!

264
00:09:47,800 --> 00:09:49,132
你觉得好受不
How do you like that? Eh?

265
00:09:50,338 --> 00:09:52,700
歌洛莉亚 我得再次提醒你
Gloria, I'm gonna have to ask you again

266
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:55,080
请照着稿子读
to please stick to your script.

267
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,140
可是每个人都拒绝我
But everybody's saying no to me!

268
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,180
我搞不懂
I don't get it.

269
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,980
平时我叫别人干嘛
Usually when I ask someone to do something,

270
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:00,980
别人就干嘛
they just do it!

271
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,200
也许是因为那些人通过电话无法看到你的美貌
Maybe it's because these people can't see you.

272
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,560
我不喜欢
I don't like it.

273
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:07,720
你不能给我弄个视频电话吗
Can't you just hook me up to some sort of camera?

274
00:10:08,304 --> 00:10:09,810
谢谢你 麦琪 谢谢支持
Well, thank you, Maggie, for the vote.

275
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:11,111
好的 再见
Okay. Bye-bye.

276
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,460
请坐在这儿
Here's your seat.

277
00:10:14,902 --> 00:10:17,689
谢谢 请原谅
Thank you. Um, you'll have to excuse me.

278
00:10:17,699 --> 00:10:20,444
我有点儿紧张 我从没上过电台
I'm a little nervous. I've never been on the radio before.

279
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,700
别担心
Don't worry about it.

280
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:23,840
-就当是聊天好了 -好的
- Just think of it as a conversation. - Okay.

281
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:26,227
这是耳机 音量控制
Here are your headphones. Volume control.

282
00:10:26,227 --> 00:10:28,300
-别离麦克风太远 -好的
- Don't get too far from the mike. - Okay.

283
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:29,680
请确认手机关闭
Make sure your cell phone's off.

284
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,960
哦 关掉手机 对...
Oh. Cell phone. Right. Um...

285
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,640
确认下你没在嚼口香糖 对吧
And you're not chewing gum, are you?

286
00:10:32,820 --> 00:10:34,700
没 我没在 只是刚做了些临时性的
No, I'm not. I just had some temporary

287
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:35,860
牙科类小手术
dental work done.

288
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:37,083
最后我只需要...
The last thing I need--

289
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:41,980
欢迎回到《时事记录》
And welcome back to "A matter of record."

290
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:43,720
我是希瑟·范·甘迪
I'm Cecil Van Gundy.

291
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:47,360
今天来到演播室的是来自43区的
Joining us now in studio is district 43

292
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:50,420
镇议会候选人克莱尔·邓菲
town council candidate Claire Dunphy.

293
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:54,100
谢谢 希瑟
Thank you, Cecil.

294
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:55,960
很高兴能参加这个节目
It's a pleasure to be here.

295
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,780
那么...你本次是首次参选
So... You're a first-time candidate.

296
00:10:58,780 --> 00:11:00,020
跟大家说说你是怎么有这个念头的
Tell us what got you involved.

297
00:11:00,020 --> 00:11:02,301
一切都始于一个...
It all started with a, um...

298
00:11:02,312 --> 00:11:03,829
一个停车标志
With a stop sign.

299
00:11:04,363 --> 00:11:08,120
我忧心于我家周围的街道安全
I was concerned about safety in our neighbourhood

300
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:12,500
并且我没有从市政厅得到满意的答复
and I was not getting any satisfaction from city hall.

301
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:13,900
老妈是抽什么风了
What's wrong with mom?

302
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,040
哦 这下可不妙
Oh, this isn't good.

303
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:16,860
她听起来跟醉了一样
She sounds drunk!

304
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:18,200
你是没听过她喝醉后的声音
That's not her drunk voice.

305
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:21,060
再说说咱们镇上存在的其他问题吧
Tell us about some of the other issues facing our town.

306
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:23,840
你对本市针对污水和可持续发展的
Where do you stand on the city's

307
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,940
倡议提案持什么样的观点
sewage and sustainability initiative,

308
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:28,060
就是所谓的"污持案"
the so-called S.S.I.?

309
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,880
如果我们要讨论
One cannot really talk about

310
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:32,020
"淤"...淤水和可持续发展的问题
s-s-sewage and sustainability

311
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:34,880
就不得不先探讨...循环利用的问题
without first discussing... recycling.

312
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:37,300
政府方面可以做得更多...
This city can do more...

313
00:11:37,308 --> 00:11:38,552
-她是想闹哪样 -针对循环利用问题
- What the hell's wrong with her? - with the recycling program...

314
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,880
跟喝醉了一样
She sounds drunk!

315
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:41,842
-当前... -都是牙给闹的
- ...currently... - It's a tooth thing.

316
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:43,580
怎么了
What's wrong?

317
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:45,654
氧气快吸完了 天啊
Oh, I'm almost out of air. Oh, boy.

318
00:11:45,771 --> 00:11:47,004
那很要紧吗
Is that serious?

319
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,660
你觉得氧气要紧吗
Is oxygen serious?

320
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:51,380
说实话 帮你取眼镜耽误了我大把时间
You know what? I lost a ton of time getting your glasses.

321
00:11:51,380 --> 00:11:52,680
我还是把你丢家里吧
I'm just gonna drop you at home.

322
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,820
你能好好吸氧 我也好去接其他人
You can get your air. I can drive other people.

323
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,080
我家里没有多余的氧气瓶了
I don't have any more tanks at home.

324
00:11:57,540 --> 00:11:59,000
怎么会 你要学会未雨绸缪啊
Why? That seems like bad planning.

325
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:00,500
我忘记再多订点了
Well, I forgot to order them.

326
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:02,480
服的药总让我很健忘
My pills make me forget things.

327
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,960
哦 靠 我该吃药了
Oh, shoot! I gotta take my pill!

328
00:12:05,280 --> 00:12:06,460
你别告诉我你药也忘带了
Please tell me you have it with you.

329
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:08,580
当然带着了 但我必须和食物一起服下
Of course I do, but I have to take 'em with food.

330
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:10,500
-是的吧? -你问我我问谁去
- Don't I? - Are you asking me?

331
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,489
对的 我就是和食物一起服下的
Uh, yes! I do take them with food!

332
00:12:13,268 --> 00:12:14,920
哦 我感觉不大好
Ooh. I don't feel so well.

333
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,460
好的 你要什么我都给你弄来
Okay, I'll get you whatever you want!

334
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:18,420
给你去搞氧气 给你去搞食物
I'll get you the air, I'll get you the food.

335
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:20,380
然后我去给你的醉媳妇儿投上一票
Then I'll vote for your drunk wife.

336
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:22,120
那可不是她酒醉的声音
That is not her drunk voice!

337
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:25,220
非常感谢你参与投票
Thank you so much for voting.

338
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,560
非常感激
We appreciate it.

339
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,320
嗨非常抱歉打扰下 我是杰·普里契特
Hi. I'm terribly sorry. Excuse me. Jay Pritchett.

340
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,276
能不能让我速战速决
Uh, can I get in-- in and out really quick?

341
00:12:35,276 --> 00:12:36,080
谢谢 给张选票就成
Thank you. This is all I needed.

342
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,300
非常感谢 非常感谢
Thank you very much. Thank you very much.

343
00:12:39,401 --> 00:12:41,311
好的 克莱尔 克莱尔 克莱尔
All right. Claire, Claire, Claire.

344
00:12:41,471 --> 00:12:43,636
克莱尔 克莱尔 在这里
Claire, Claire-- ahh, ahh. Here.

345
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,060
抱歉 抱歉 抱歉
I'm sorry! I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

346
00:12:49,594 --> 00:12:50,921
好啊 多蒂
Hello, Dottie!

347
00:12:55,347 --> 00:12:58,466
杰 见到你可真开心
Jay! It's so nice to see you!

348
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:00,540
-是吗 -哦 为什么不开心
- Is it? - Oh, why wouldn't it be?

349
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:04,620
都是陈年旧事 过眼云烟了
That was a long time ago. Water under the bridge.

350
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,120
-没关系的 -哦 那就好
- We're good. - Oh, that's great.

351
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,440
非常感谢你参加投票
Thank you so much for voting.

352
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:11,220
还记得我女儿克莱尔吗 她现在...
You remember my daughter Claire. She's--

353
00:13:11,230 --> 00:13:12,686
正在参选镇议会议员
She's running for town council.

354
00:13:12,686 --> 00:13:15,752
-哦 真是不错啊 -我真为她骄傲
- Oh, isn't that neat? - Yeah, I'm so proud.

355
00:13:17,112 --> 00:13:18,674
你该把选票放进去吧
So you're gonna put it in there, huh?

356
00:13:18,723 --> 00:13:21,037
是啊当然 当然要放进去
Oh, yeah, of course. Yeah. Definitely.

357
00:13:21,037 --> 00:13:23,120
每一票都很重要 是吧
cause every vote counts, you know.

358
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,980
非常感谢你能参与投票
Thank you so much for voting.

359
00:13:26,004 --> 00:13:26,996
-我说... -是啊
- You know... - Yeah.

360
00:13:26,996 --> 00:13:29,360
天啊 我要亲眼看到我这宝贵的
Boy, I'd sure like to see the sweet sight

361
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:31,560
一票...计算在内
of my vote... counting.

362
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,760
我为什么要许诺某事却不履行呢
Why would I say I'd do something and not do it?

363
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:36,340
我这不就成了个骗子了嘛
That would make me a liar...

364
00:13:36,740 --> 00:13:38,280
我只是个容易轻信别人的寡妇
instead of a trusting widow

365
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:40,220
曾经睡倒在一个男人温暖的怀抱中
Who fell asleep in the warm embrace

366
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:42,560
他可答应我 要给我做早餐呢
of a man who promised to make breakfast.

367
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,500
很好 该来的躲不掉
Okay, here it is.

368
00:13:44,987 --> 00:13:46,586
听着 我十分抱歉
Look, I am so sorry.

369
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:50,300
和前妻离婚后你是我遇到的第一个女人
You were the first woman I'd been with besides my ex--

370
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:51,200
35年的婚姻
35 years.

371
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:52,780
我慌了手脚
I panicked.

372
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:55,380
我倒不是说你脱光了就不漂亮
An-and it wasn't 'cause y-you weren't pretty naked

373
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:56,300
或者类似的什么原因
or anything like that.

374
00:13:56,300 --> 00:13:57,999
我要躲着安琪·迪金森啊
I'd have run from Angie Dickinson.

375
00:13:57,999 --> 00:13:59,930
-哦 她可真幸运 -多蒂
- Oh, lucky her. - Dottie--

376
00:13:59,930 --> 00:14:01,640
-回见 杰 -多蒂 多蒂 拜托
- Good-bye, Jay! - Dottie, Dottie, please.

377
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:03,260
我就是想把我的票塞进"洞"
I'm just trying to get my ballot in the box.

378
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,820
果然还是老样子
oh, yeah, that sounds familiar.

379
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,700
恩 都不用麻烦你做什么
Yeah, but you don't have to do anything.

380
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,020
让我自己把它"插进去"
Just let me put it in!

381
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:09,447
我这话听起来真别扭
Uhh. Shouldn't have said that.

382
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,760
我们实在太对不起了
We are so sorry.

383
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:15,720
我们不是故意让你听到那些话的
We did not mean for you to hear any of that.

384
00:14:15,730 --> 00:14:16,380
对 其实
Yes, and you know what?

385
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:18,120
我们一开始就不该八卦你的
We shouldn't have been gossiping in the first place.

386
00:14:18,137 --> 00:14:19,600
万一你们是对的呢
But what if you're right?

387
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,100
格雷戈里就是个同性恋怎么办
What if Gregory is gay?

388
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,200
我妈跟我说过 我没敢信她
When my mom said it, I didn't believe her.

389
00:14:23,220 --> 00:14:24,000
毕竟她住在爱荷华[允许同性婚姻]
She lives in Iowa.

390
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,140
不过要是你们也这么认为
But coming from you two!

391
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:26,060
-完全证明不了什么 -对
- Means nothing. - No.

392
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:28,000
我们对你的未婚夫一无所知
We barely know your fiance.

393
00:14:28,011 --> 00:14:31,200
-他说自己是直男 他就是 -直男
- If he says he's straight, he's straight. - Mm. Straight.

394
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,600
我们下个月就要结婚了
We're getting married in a month.

395
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,880
人们都往这儿赶来了
People are flying in.

396
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:35,320
他为我俩报了舞蹈课
He signed us up for dance classes.

397
00:14:35,420 --> 00:14:36,080
哦 天啊
Oh, my god!

398
00:14:36,327 --> 00:14:37,935
别 不要这样 嘿
No. No, no, no. Hey.

399
00:14:37,935 --> 00:14:39,350
-基佬就爱这样 -对
- This is what gays do. - Yeah.

400
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:40,540
-喜欢聊八卦 -大聊特聊
- We gossip. - We gossip a lot.

401
00:14:40,540 --> 00:14:41,520
他也爱八卦
He gossips!

402
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:43,920
不是的 你没理解我的意思
No. No. You're missing the point, okay?

403
00:14:44,102 --> 00:14:45,760
每当我们看到像格雷戈里那样的美男子
We see a great-looking guy like Gregory,

404
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:48,380
就会说他是基佬 因为我们希望他是
and we say he's gay because we want him to be gay!

405
00:14:48,431 --> 00:14:50,920
-是吗 你们确定吗 -是这样的
- Really? Really? Are you sure? - Yes. Yes.

406
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,900
就是这样 见过我们怎么对待影星吗
Absolutely. Look at what we do with movie stars.

407
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:53,180
对
Okay.

408
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,660
知道吗 休·杰克曼 他又会唱又会跳
You know? Hugh Jackman-- he sings, he dances,

409
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:56,720
真是梦中情人
He's dreamy!

410
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,400
很明显我们特想他与我们站在"同"一战线
So obviously we would want him on our team!

411
00:14:59,574 --> 00:15:01,400
-对 -但他就是个直男
- Yeah. - But he's straight.

412
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:03,020
相信我 我很清楚的
Trust me, I know.

413
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:04,940
有一次我在餐厅里跟他打招呼
I said hello to him once in a restaurant,

414
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:07,560
那一刻我嗅不到丝毫的基情
and there was absolutely no chemistry.

415
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:09,260
是啊 说到这份儿上你要还不信...
Well, if that isn't proof...

416
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:12,140
三个星期后 桑迪和格雷戈里结了婚
Three weeks later, Sandy and Gregory got married,

417
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:14,340
每个人都说那婚礼美极了
and everyone said the wedding was beautiful.

418
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,160
那些花可都是格雷戈里布置的
Gregory did the flowers....

419
00:15:17,420 --> 00:15:19,560
对于一个直男来说 其实一点都"不奇怪"
Which is perfectly normal for a straight guy.

420
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:25,440
希腊人就一件事做得靠谱 就这羊肉
The Greeks do one thing right, and it's lamb!

421
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,400
好了 咱赶紧去投票吧
All right. Let's go vote.

422
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:29,720
你家媳妇儿哪根经搭错了非要跑去当政客
Why the hell does your wife want to be a politician, anyway?

423
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:31,740
她不刚说过 她就想在布里斯托路和
You heard her. She wanted to put up

424
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:33,420
绿叶路那放块停车标志
a stop sign at Bristol and Greenleaf,

425
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:34,500
然后她遇到...
But then she ran into--

426
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:35,120
等等 慢着
Wait, wait, wait!

427
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,340
我住的地方就离那不远
That's near where I live!

428
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,580
对啊 我们是邻居呢 走吧
Yeah. We're neighbors. Let's go!

429
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:40,360
我才不会给这事投票呢
No way I'm voting for that!

430
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,140
政府已经管得太宽了
Too much government already.

431
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,420
我为国上战场可不是为了让政客来告诉我
I didn't fight a war so some politician

432
00:15:44,620 --> 00:15:46,800
我该在哪个地方停车
could tell me where I have to stop my car.

433
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,540
你根本就不开车
You don't even drive!

434
00:15:48,540 --> 00:15:51,280
那是因为奥巴马那家伙把我驾照吊销了
That's 'cause that Barack Obama took my license away.

435
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:53,120
我可不觉得那事跟他有关
I don't think he was involved in the decision!

436
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:56,040
我今天出门是要给我老婆拉到50票的
I left the house today to get 50 votes for my wife.

437
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,500
我才不要一票都没有就回家
I'm not going home with zero.

438
00:15:57,500 --> 00:15:59,820
你至少能帮帮忙 走进去
The least you can do is walk right in there

439
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:01,280
替我家媳妇投上一票
and punch a hole for the woman

440
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:03,800
她每周二都帮你把垃圾桶推上车道啊
who drags your garbage can up your driveway every Tuesday!

441
00:16:03,885 --> 00:16:06,967
我不喜欢 那跟我的全部信仰都背道而驰
I don't like it! Goes against everything I believe in.

442
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:08,340
是吗 就一个停车标志
Really? A stop sign?!

443
00:16:08,340 --> 00:16:10,796
不过我会去的 因为你是个好孩子
But I'll do it, 'cause you're a good kid.

444
00:16:11,460 --> 00:16:13,500
我今天原本过得也还不错
And I had a nice day...

445
00:16:14,015 --> 00:16:15,798
直到你冲我吼了起来
till you started yelling at me.

446
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:18,440
十分抱歉 谢谢你了
So sorry. Thank you.

447
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:19,560
走吧
Here you go.

448
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:23,060
告诉你 我老婆以前也是个酒鬼
You know, my wife was an alcoholic, too.

449
00:16:23,060 --> 00:16:24,320
好吧 投个票而已
Okay. Let's just go vote.

450
00:16:24,590 --> 00:16:27,915
那是老兵政治记者
That's veteran political reporter

451
00:16:27,925 --> 00:16:28,494
沃特·夏皮洛
Walter Shapiro.

452
00:16:28,494 --> 00:16:30,332
大家好啊
Hi, everyone!

453
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,860
-有什么新闻吗 -还没 还没
- Any news? - Not yet, not yet,

454
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,640
不过即使我输了 至少我知道
But even if I lose, at least now I know

455
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,380
我在播音界还是有点前途的
I have a future in radio.

456
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:40,380
我就不行 人得要看见我的脸才行
I couldn't. People need to see me.

457
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:43,660
在拿到结果之前 我想要感谢你们大家
Before we get the results, I just want to thank you all

458
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:45,480
感谢你们为我做的所有事
for everything you've done for me.

459
00:16:46,180 --> 00:16:50,280
米奇和小卡 谢谢你们一整天
Mitch and Cam, for campaigning for me all day

460
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,107
开着你们的"克莱尔号"为我竞选
in your little Claire-mobile.

461
00:16:52,107 --> 00:16:53,860
-那是我们至少可以做到的 -对
- It's the least we could do. - Yeah.

462
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:54,340
是真的"少"
Literally.

463
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:56,680
我们为休·杰克曼的电影做的宣传
We probably did more for Hugh Jackman's career

464
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:57,640
可能都比为克莱尔做的多
than we did for Claire's.

465
00:16:57,640 --> 00:17:00,600
还有曼尼和歌洛莉亚
And, Manny and Gloria,

466
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,620
谢谢你们打了那么多电话
thank you for making all those phone calls.

467
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:04,340
还有 爸爸
And, dad...

468
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:06,020
谢谢你的支持
for all your support.

469
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:09,000
我觉得我没有说服一个人为克莱尔投票
I don't think I convinced anyone to vote for Claire.

470
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,580
我自己好像都没投上票
I don't think I even voted.

471
00:17:11,440 --> 00:17:12,640
还有我老公
And my husband...

472
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:15,800
四处开车
who drove around

473
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:20,340
送了不知道多少位老人去投票
I don't know how many senior citizens today to the polls.

474
00:17:21,220 --> 00:17:22,020
一位
One.

475
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:24,960
还有我可爱的孩子们
And my beautiful children,

476
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:28,060
是你们的信念让我有信心
whose faith has given me the confidence

477
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:29,940
相信我可以做到
to believe that I can do this.

478
00:17:29,940 --> 00:17:30,839
我可以
I can--oh.

479
00:17:30,839 --> 00:17:32,437
-谁来接 我输了 -妈妈 妈妈
- Somebody else answer it. I lost. - Mom. Mom.

480
00:17:32,437 --> 00:17:33,066
-我可以感觉得到 -妈妈
- I can feel it. I-- - Mom.

481
00:17:33,066 --> 00:17:34,993
你可以的 妈妈 接电话吧
You can do it. Mom. Answer the phone.

482
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:38,220
你好
Hello?

483
00:17:39,380 --> 00:17:39,940
我就是
This is she.

484
00:17:43,780 --> 00:17:45,080
谢谢你打电话通知我
Thanks so much for calling.

485
00:17:45,447 --> 00:17:46,407
再见
Bye-bye.

486
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,280
有个坏消息
I have some bad news.

487
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:57,820
因为你当上议员要变忙了吗
Because someone's gonna be busy now that she's a councilwoman?

488
00:17:59,375 --> 00:18:01,032
不 我没有在跟你们开玩笑
No, no, I wasn't doing that fake thing.

489
00:18:01,042 --> 00:18:05,193
-我真输了 我输了 -不是吧
- I really lost. I lost. - Ay, no.

490
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:09,520
真遗憾 不过 你知道吗
I'm so sorry. But you know what?

491
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:13,420
我们都还是非常为你骄傲
We are still just so proud of you.

492
00:18:15,449 --> 00:18:17,693
我不知道你们怎么想的
Yeah! I-- I don't know about you,

493
00:18:17,693 --> 00:18:20,630
反正 我要喝一杯酒
But, um... I could use a glass of wine.

494
00:18:24,168 --> 00:18:26,432
现在你们能听到她喝醉的嗓音了
Ohh. Now you're gonna hear her drunk voice.

495
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,480
妈妈
Mom?

496
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:33,940
你还好吧
You okay?

497
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,980
是的 好着呢
Yes. Fine. I'm good.

498
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,080
我很好 我不好 我是想赢的
I'm fine. I'm not fine. I wanted to win,

499
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:40,921
然后 我现在很尴尬
And... and I'm so embarrassed.

500
00:18:42,443 --> 00:18:45,871
外边所有人都为我而努力
I mean, everybody out here worked so hard for me,

501
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,160
都信任我
and they believed in me,

502
00:18:48,485 --> 00:18:49,706
而我让他们失望了
and I let 'em down.

503
00:18:52,778 --> 00:18:54,029
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

504
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:55,580
乖女儿
Oh, sweetheart.

505
00:18:55,592 --> 00:18:59,960
别哭啊 我会没事的
Well, don't cry. I'm gonna be fine, sweetie.

506
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:01,100
真的 我会没事的
Really, I am.

507
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:04,500
知道你这么在乎 我就已经好多了
Just knowing you care so much makes me feel better.

508
00:19:05,685 --> 00:19:07,860
不是 我收到4封拒信
No, I got four rejection letters

509
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:10,060
一直没告诉你们
I never told you guys about.

510
00:19:12,153 --> 00:19:13,140
什么
What?

511
00:19:13,834 --> 00:19:17,980
加州圣巴巴拉分校 俄勒冈 威斯康辛
I got rejected from U.C.S.B., Oregon, Wisconsin...

512
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,320
-不是吧 -还有西北大学的
- Oh, no. - And Northwestern.

513
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,580
那一个我们是有点高攀了
Well, we were overshooting on that one.

514
00:19:22,167 --> 00:19:23,351
那那个
What about, uh...

515
00:19:23,351 --> 00:19:26,614
今天收到的 最后的机会了
It came today. My last chance.

516
00:19:27,798 --> 00:19:29,250
我不敢打开
I'm too scared to open it.

517
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,000
无论它怎么说
Whatever it says in there,

518
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:34,240
你爹和我都超级为你自豪
your father and I are crazy proud of you.

519
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,080
好吗
Okay?

520
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:37,120
我今年真的有开始努力
I did start trying this year.

521
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:38,900
我知道的 你努力了
I know you did. You did.

522
00:19:38,985 --> 00:19:40,810
没有什么好羞耻的
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

523
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,400
你也一样
Neither do you.

524
00:19:45,860 --> 00:19:47,140
还是有点不一样的
It's a little bit different.

525
00:19:47,140 --> 00:19:50,440
不 其实完全一样
No, it's exactly the same.

526
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:53,360
不同的是 你一直都很努力
Except you tried really hard the whole time,

527
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:55,140
而不是临时抱佛脚
not just at the end.

528
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:57,440
你说的对
You're right.

529
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,640
是一样的
It is the same.

530
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,280
我们没什么可感到羞耻的
We have nothing to be ashamed of...

531
00:20:01,280 --> 00:20:03,340
一起把它打开吧
So let's open that together.

532
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,420
对 打开吧
Yeah, open it.

533
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:07,400
什么 不行 你们在这儿干吗
What? No! What are you doing here?

534
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:09,116
来嘛海莉 我们都相信你
No. Come on, haley. We believe in you.

535
00:20:09,116 --> 00:20:09,789
开封吧
Do it!

536
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:11,900
实在没学校要 就来给我打工
You can always work for me.

537
00:20:12,079 --> 00:20:13,883
来吧 你可以的 你可以的
Come on. You can do it. You can do this.

538
00:20:13,883 --> 00:20:14,880
-来吧海莉 -好吧
- Come on, Haley. - All right.

539
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,660
打开 打开 打开 打开
Open. Open, open, open.

540
00:20:20,818 --> 00:20:22,207
亲爱的邓菲小姐
"Dear Miss Dunphy,

541
00:20:22,620 --> 00:20:24,500
我们很遗憾地通知你
We regret to inform you..."

542
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:25,580
宝贝儿
Oh, honey.

543
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:28,600
虽然我们现在不能给你入学通知
"While we cannot offer you admission at this time,

544
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,740
但你是很棒的候选人 因此
"You are a promising candidate, and therefore

545
00:20:30,740 --> 00:20:32,520
我们很乐意将你放在候选名单中
We would like to place you on our wait list!"

546
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:33,919
我的天 我进候选名单了
Oh, my god, I got wait-listed!

547
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:35,780
我们收下了
We will take it!

548
00:20:35,780 --> 00:20:37,434
太好了
Yeah!

549
00:20:38,290 --> 00:20:39,579
恭喜啊 恭喜啊
Congratulations! Congratulations!

550
00:20:39,579 --> 00:20:43,290
我们女儿可能要去上大学了
Our daughter might be going to college!

551
00:20:48,084 --> 00:20:50,289
菲尔 看
Phil, look.

552
00:20:51,627 --> 00:20:52,818
一个停车牌
A stop sign.

553
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:55,500
写着你收
It's addressed to you.

554
00:20:59,660 --> 00:21:02,320
亲爱的克莱尔 我赢了 你输了
"Dear Claire, I won. You lost.

555
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:04,060
收下你傻兮兮的停车标志
"Here's your stupid stop sign.

556
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:05,640
下次要想来烦扰我
"Next time you think about bothering me,

557
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:07,318
请也"停止"吧
"Please take its advice.

558
00:21:07,394 --> 00:21:10,493
议员 可敬的杜恩·贝利敬上
Your councilman, the honorable Duane Bailey."

559
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:12,620
亲爱的 你做到了
Honey, you did it!

560
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:13,720
我做到了
I did it.

561
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,460
我让邻里变得更安全了
I made our neighborhood a little bit safer.

562
00:21:16,820 --> 00:21:18,520
我搞不好已经救了人命了
I may have even saved life.

563
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:24,860
你个傻缺 有停车标志呢 你不识字吗
You idiot, there's stop sign! Can't you read?

564
00:21:25,980 --> 00:21:26,820
我们需要减速带
we need speed bumps.

565
00:21:27,420 --> 00:21:29,520
不不 不行 亲爱的
No, no. No! Honey!
